UNOFFICIAL FAN TRANSLATION PATCH — ALL RIGHTS RESERVED BY ORIGINAL OWNERS

This repository distributes an unofficial fan-made Portuguese (Brazil) text patch
for the visual novel:

  メイドちゃんは迷途ちゅう (Maid-chan wa Meido-chuu)
  by CloverGAME

IMPORTANT

1. This project is NOT affiliated with, endorsed by, or connected to CloverGAME
   or any rightsholder of the original work.

2. This patch does NOT include the original game. You must own a legitimate copy
   of the game to use these files.

3. The original game's story, characters, art, audio, code, and trademarks remain
   the exclusive property of their respective owners.

4. This patch only replaces in-game text (and minimal font-related system settings)
   inside the already-installed game archives. Do not redistribute the full game.

5. Translation quality is machine-assisted / MTL and may contain errors.

6. Provided "AS IS", without warranty of any kind. Use at your own risk.

If you are a rightsholder and want this removed, open an issue or contact the
repository owner.
